    m_Localized: MAIN MENU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351873
    m_Localized: "Torque  +{0}% \u2192 +{1}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351874
    m_Localized: No additional drawbacks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351875
    m_Localized: Higher torque improves acceleration when grip is available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351876
    m_Localized: "Brake torque  +{0}% \u2192 +{1}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351877
    m_Localized: Front-to-rear brake balance is retained
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351878
    m_Localized: Higher brake torque adds braking force. Grip and ABS still limit
      stopping distance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351879
    m_Localized: "Springs  +{0:0.#}% \u2192 +{1:0.#}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351880
    m_Localized: "Damping +{0:0.#}% \xB7 Anti-roll +{1:0.#}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351881
    m_Localized: Sharper chassis response, but less compliance over bumps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351882
    m_Localized: "Downforce  +{0}% \u2192 +{1}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351883
    m_Localized: "Drag  +{0}% \u2192 +{1}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8534351884
    m_Localized: More grip in fast corners, but more air resistance.
